{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56330","headline":"红梅 · 周濆","name":"红梅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"姑射仙人笑脸开，肯将脂粉涴香腮。\n只因悮入桃源洞，惹得春风上面来。\n（见《永乐大典》卷二八○九，中华书局影印本第三五册。\n）（按：《粤诗蒐逸》卷二引《连州志》谓濆爲渭弟。\n若其言可信，则濆应爲南汉末至宋初入。\n惜尚无从证定，姑仍从《全唐诗》收入事迹无考作者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}